  "prefLabel": "Alc 308.01 Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 308.01 Eligibility.\n\n(a) For purposes of obtaining a license by endorsement in a profession regulated by the board, the current requirements of the licensing jurisdiction shall be the requirements as stated in Plc 313.15.\n\n(b) Applicants for licensure by endorsement shall apply as required by Plc 313.03 and complete the process for requesting a criminal records check as required by RSA 330-C:20.\n\nSource. #14584, eff 7-14-26, EXPIRES: 7-14-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/alc100-500.html"
